anthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-02T16:04:31-08:00","id":1364865,"title":"","content":"You're welcome. <br /> <br /> Note that it also has an option that lets you request a desktop version of the site you're viewing; that's essential for this sort of thing, as the mobile device version of the site doesn't give you the Avatar pic to mouse-over: it assumes that you'll be using a desktop when you want to change things like your Avatar. <br /> <br /> Two caveats:<br /> <br /> 1. Puffin isn't free. I believe there is a free version; but as with all free versions, it's somewhat crippled to encourage you to buy the full version. <br /> <br /> 2. What I first got it, it had some performance issues that causes me to use it as a browser of last resort \u2014 I would only use it when I <i>needed</i> access to the handful of browser features that no other mobile browser provides. It has improved since then, so your experience may be better than mine was; but be aware that I'm not giving it a 5-Star review. I'm just pointing out that it has a handful of useful features that no other mobile browser